; Borrowed silhouette, distinct tint: Firewall Node's bolted-down emitter already reads as
; "this does not move" (see its own header comment), which is exactly Compiler's job too.
; Cyan-blue rather than Firewall Node's amber so the two are never mistaken for each other,
; and because it fits README's "cyan and violet machinery" palette for Development. A
; dedicated sprite is a later art pass, not this one.
modulate = Color(0.55, 0.85, 0.95, 1)

